{"seq":1,"mint":"C3","verb":"claim","status":"ok","model":"openai/gpt-5.6-luna","approach":"split","literals":false,"findings":[{"kind":"contradicts","clause":"The `Search` observation's label is the only part of a grep census that reaches a committed memo","clause_quoted":true,"facts":["F2","F22","F27","F31"],"quoted_from":"output","evidence":"kind: ObservationKind::GrepMatch,\n                key: resolve_key(Path::new(&file)),\n                label: format!(\"{file} (grep: {pattern})\"),\n                output: matches.join(\"\\n\"),","why":"The grep census creates per-file `GrepMatch` observations with their own labels, and the memo renderer emits every fact extent label via `e.label.as_str()`. Therefore a grep census can contribute labels other than the `Search` observation's label.","quoted":true}],"at":1790113110,"cost":0.00980088,"elapsed_ms":74588,"attempts":3,"not_verbatim":0,"literals_refuted":0,"not_a_quantity":0,"kind_off_verb":0,"refuted":0}
